<title>USA: TABLE - Carolina First Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Carolina First Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED  SIX MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>				   6/30/97  6/30/96  6/30/97  6/30/96</p>
<p> Net income		   $    4,661    2,672   6,378   4,900</p>
<p>Income per common share diluted</p>
<p>					  0.41     0.24    0.56    0.43</p>
<p>Average common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		     11,436   11,347  11,457  11,335</p>
<p>(In thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Carolina First Corp said net income for the second quarter of 1997 included $1.5 million (after-tax), or $0.13 per fully diluted share, from a gain associated with the sale of five branches.</p>
